guide:read-accessibility-first a harness:Guide ;
    rdfs:label "read ACCESSIBILITY.md before changing what people see" ;
    rdfs:comment "Before any change to a user interface or rendered output, read ACCESSIBILITY.md and keep its rules; give every named accessibility check in a PR or ACCESSIBILITY.md a Pass, Fail or Blocked result with evidence (test or command, tool and version used, or why it could not run); retain unrun checks as Blocked, including screen readers, never not applicable; for changes to what people see, include a PR Accessibility section with a Check | Result | Evidence table; never claim testing that did not happen, and never weaken a check to make a change pass." ;
    harness:statedIn "AGENTS.md" ; harness:section "7. Read ACCESSIBILITY.md before changing what people see" ;
    harness:direction harness:feedforward ; harness:execution harness:inferential ;
    harness:stage harness:toolCall ; harness:category harness:behavior .
